  "quotes": [
    "Table 4: Ablations over the full matrix (48 settings ×\\times 10 seeds, mean±\\pmstd across seeds). Each variant replaces Geo-Con in the ranking against the five deployable baselines. Top, component ablation, best per column in bold; bottom, sensitivity to kk (default k=10k{=}10 is the full rule).\nVariant\nFinal acc (%)\nAULC (%)\nRank↓\\downarrow\nfull rule, Eq. (3)\n76.78±\\pm0.17\n71.99±\\pm0.19\n1.08\nno fit term ℓ\\ell\n75.09±\\pm0.28\n71.22±\\pm0.21\n1.77",
    "no kk-NN term aknna^{\\mathrm{knn}}\n76.64±\\pm0.25\n71.93±\\pm0.20\n1.10\nno NCM term ancma^{\\mathrm{ncm}}\n76.74±\\pm0.17\n71.82±\\pm0.19\n1.31\nancma^{\\mathrm{ncm}} only\n74.44±\\pm0.32\n70.77±\\pm0.21\n2.27\naknna^{\\mathrm{knn}} only\n76.26±\\pm0.16\n71.50±\\pm0.19\n1.77",
    "ℓ\\ell only\n76.56±\\pm0.17\n71.74±\\pm0.22\n1.48\nk=5k{=}5\n76.75±\\pm0.16\n71.96±\\pm0.22\n1.17\nk=10k{=}10 (default)\n76.78±\\pm0.17\n71.99±\\pm0.19\n1.08\nk=20k{=}20\n76.78±\\pm0.17\n71.92±\\pm0.24\n1.23",
    "Removing any component costs performance, though by different amounts.\nDropping the fit term ℓ\\ell hurts most (−0.77-0.77 pp AULC, rank 1.77), dropping the NCM term ancma^{\\mathrm{ncm}} is second (−0.17-0.17, rank 1.31), and dropping the kk-NN term aknna^{\\mathrm{knn}} is smallest (−0.07-0.07, rank 1.10).\nOn top of the fit term alone, the two geometric terms add 0.25 pp AULC and improve the rank from 1.48 to 1.08"
  ],
